{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Machinery.H4AsciiPresentation","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4AsciiPresentation","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Machinery.MarkovTraceH4"],"declarations":16,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.mulNF_expand_right","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.mulNF_expand_right","kind":"theorem","line":180,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/H4AsciiPresentation.lean#L180-L187","doc":"Expansion of the ASCII NF product along the right basis:\n`u · v = ∑_j v_j • (u · b_j)`. This is the form the basis bridge reindexes. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.mulNF_e_right","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.mulNF_e_right","kind":"theorem","line":174,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/H4AsciiPresentation.lean#L174-L178","doc":"**Right basis action**: `u · b_j = wordActionA j u`; the coefficient vector\n`e j` selects exactly the `j`-th composite. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.basis_decompA","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.basis_decompA","kind":"theorem","line":168,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/H4AsciiPresentation.lean#L168-L172","doc":"Basis decomposition `u = ∑ᵢ uᵢ • e i` on the ASCII basis. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.mulNF_sum_right","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.mulNF_sum_right","kind":"theorem","line":159,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/H4AsciiPresentation.lean#L159-L166","doc":"`mulNF u ·` commutes with finite sums in the right argument. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.mulNF_zero_right","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.mulNF_zero_right","kind":"theorem","line":155,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/H4AsciiPresentation.lean#L155-L157","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.wordActionA","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.wordActionA","kind":"def","line":126,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/H4AsciiPresentation.lean#L126-L153","doc":"The right action of the `j`-th ASCII NF basis word, `u ↦ u · b_j` — the same\n24 composites `mulNF` sums over, packaged as a function of the index.\nCounterpart of `HeckeH4AlgebraLaws.wordAction`, on the other table. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.mulσ0_mulσ1_ne","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.mulσ0_mulσ1_ne","kind":"theorem","line":104,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/H4AsciiPresentation.lean#L104-L109","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.mulσ10_e0_apply_eight","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.mulσ10_e0_apply_eight","kind":"theorem","line":100,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/H4AsciiPresentation.lean#L100-L102","doc":"`σ₁σ₀` sends it to position 7 instead, so position 8 is zero. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.mulσ01_e0_apply_eight","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.mulσ01_e0_apply_eight","kind":"theorem","line":96,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/H4AsciiPresentation.lean#L96-L98","doc":"`σ₀σ₁` sends the identity basis vector to basis position 8. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.e0","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.e0","kind":"def","line":90,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/H4AsciiPresentation.lean#L90-L94","doc":"The identity basis vector of the ASCII normal-form module, written as a\n`Matrix.vecCons` literal so that `mulσ` indexing reduces by the standard\n`cons_val` simp set. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.mulσ_braid12","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.mulσ_braid12","kind":"theorem","line":80,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/H4AsciiPresentation.lean#L80-L82","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.mulσ_braid01","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.mulσ_braid01","kind":"theorem","line":76,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/H4AsciiPresentation.lean#L76-L78","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.mulσ_farcomm02","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.mulσ_farcomm02","kind":"theorem","line":70,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/H4AsciiPresentation.lean#L70-L72","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.mulσ_sq2","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.mulσ_sq2","kind":"theorem","line":62,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/H4AsciiPresentation.lean#L62-L63","signatureChu